There.

664
45:00.840 --> 45:01.590
Oh,

665
45:02.230 --> 45:03.280
that's Grandpa Aek.

666
45:04.210 --> 45:05.680
He's a veteran soldier.

667
45:06.440 --> 45:08.590
He usually brings his boys to hang out here.

668
45:10.800 --> 45:12.960
I'll be like that when I'm old.

669
45:13.500 --> 45:15.400
Old, but still spicy.

670
45:17.780 --> 45:18.760
You are already old.

671
45:19.840 --> 45:20.560
I can hear you.

672
45:38.900 --> 45:39.700
Gear.

673
45:40.230 --> 45:40.920
Yes.

674
45:42.740 --> 45:45.920
Have you ever thought about what to do after graduation?

675
45:50.880 --> 45:52.320
I haven't decided yet.

676
45:53.790 --> 45:56.680
I'll probably take care of this restaurant.

677
45:58.560 --> 46:00.440
What about you?

678
46:02.080 --> 46:03.560
I want to own this restaurant.

679
46:05.560 --> 46:06.320
Huh?

680
46:06.960 --> 46:10.160
Are you going to buy my Grandpa's restaurant?

681
46:12.290 --> 46:14.040
I'm going to be a son-in-law in your family.

682
46:17.300 --> 46:18.080
Gear,

683
46:19.840 --> 46:21.440
after you graduate, let's get married.

684
46:26.840 --> 46:27.800
Kim...

685
46:30.160 --> 46:31.750
Let's be together until we're old

686
46:31.770 --> 46:33.200
like your granddad and grandpa, alright?

687
47:07.480 --> 47:08.400
Gear,

688
47:10.200 --> 47:11.380
will you dance with me?

689
47:15.760 --> 47:16.760
So?

690
48:11.370 --> 48:12.440
I'm sorry.

691
48:15.160 --> 48:15.800
For what?

692
48:18.680 --> 48:20.560
For upsetting you.

693
48:31.190 --> 48:32.480
If you want to cry,

694
48:33.320 --> 48:34.400
just let it out.

695
48:42.620 --> 48:49.760
♫I used to think love was just a mirage♫

696
48:50.250 --> 48:57.840
♫What people have said must have been a dreamy facade♫

697
48:58.730 --> 49:02.260
♫Thank you for teaching me♫

698
49:02.290 --> 49:06.360
♫What love can be♫

699
49:06.380 --> 49:08.640
♫"Love" used to mean nothing,♫

700
49:08.660 --> 49:13.900
♫But now it's starting to have a meaning♫

701
49:13.920 --> 49:17.420
♫The love you gave me♫

702
49:17.450 --> 49:22.000
♫Was very fulfilling, you helped me realize♫

703
49:22.040 --> 49:29.400
♫That this love is meant for you and me♫

704
49:31.610 --> 49:32.660
I'm going to Bang Saen.

705
49:32.680 --> 49:34.870
Bang Saen? Are you fucking nuts?

706
49:35.410 --> 49:36.280
Nu,

707
49:36.630 --> 49:38.960
- I'll see you later. - See you later, Nu.

708
49:39.000 --> 49:40.200
- Get home safely. See you. - Huh?

709
49:40.430 --> 49:41.920
Nu, you're not going home yet?

710
49:42.400 --> 49:43.880
Oh? You're not going?

711
49:44.420 --> 49:46.880
- Then we'll get going. - Yeah, bye.

712
49:50.640 --> 49:52.880
How are you going home today? Want me to take you home?

713
49:54.630 --> 49:56.720
Maybe next time.

714
49:57.400 --> 49:59.200
I'm waiting for my boyfriend.

715
50:10.680 --> 50:12.280
Oh? Why...

716
50:12.740 --> 50:14.120
Why didn't you leave with Zee?

717
50:14.660 --> 50:16.590
I'll keep you company.

718
50:17.160 --> 50:19.110
I'll leave when your boyfriend arrives.

719
50:20.520 --> 50:22.440
Oh, is that alright with you?

720
50:35.840 --> 50:36.600
Boss,

721
50:37.040 --> 50:38.610
I sent you the information

722
50:39.030 --> 50:41.320
you asked me to investigate.

723
50:45.630 --> 50:48.280
Shin just came back from overseas.

724
50:49.270 --> 50:50.990
Chai has never taken him to any events,

725
50:51.010 --> 50:52.120
because he's his illegitimate son.

726
50:52.860 --> 50:56.080
Ever since his eldest son passed from an accident,

727
50:57.620 --> 50:59.690
Chai tried to push Shin

728
50:59.710 --> 51:01.240
to become his successor.

729
51:12.150 --> 51:13.080
Thanks a lot.

730
51:13.850 --> 51:14.780
Yes, Boss.

731
51:33.120 --> 51:35.000
You've been waiting for half an hour now.

732
51:36.150 --> 51:37.840
I don't think he's coming.

733
51:44.780 --> 51:46.140
He said he's on his way.

734
51:46.900 --> 51:47.880
He's almost here.

735
51:50.680 --> 51:51.560
There.

736
51:57.240 --> 51:58.280
Sorry,

737
51:58.770 --> 52:00.320
I was too invested in the livestream.

738
52:00.660 --> 52:01.840
- My bad. - Mm.

739
52:02.080 --> 52:02.960
It's okay.

740
52:04.040 --> 52:04.640
Let's go.

741
52:05.600 --> 52:07.920
Try to get here on time, will you?

742
52:08.350 --> 52:10.350
You shouldn't let my friend sit here waiting for you.

743
52:14.240 --> 52:15.080
Bank.

744
52:19.920 --> 52:21.400
Thanks for the advice.

745
52:22.420 --> 52:23.960
But even Nu hasn't said anything.

746
52:26.440 --> 52:27.680
So how is this your business?

747
52:28.410 --> 52:30.680
I just don't want my friend to sit here and wait for someone.

748
52:31.380 --> 52:33.000
If you can't drive him around,

749
52:33.220 --> 52:34.180
then don't.

750
52:34.570 --> 52:35.520
I can do it.

751
52:48.270 --> 52:50.960
Your granddad and grandpa's restaurant is pretty heartwarming.

752
52:52.040 --> 52:53.120
I never thought

753
52:53.650 --> 52:55.120
there'd be a place like this.

754
52:55.940 --> 52:57.160
I'll visit here again.

755
53:00.920 --> 53:01.720
Oh,

756
53:02.640 --> 53:04.240
where should we meet tomorrow?

757
53:05.040 --> 53:06.080
Should it be Rose Club?

758
53:06.480 --> 53:07.880
Or my condo?

759
53:13.520 --> 53:14.680
Um...

760
53:15.570 --> 53:16.760
I...

761
53:17.640 --> 53:19.520
Are you still mad about yesterday?

762
53:22.280 --> 53:24.280
I don't know what I did wrong.

763
53:25.240 --> 53:27.080
But if you think I was too harsh,

764
53:28.460 --> 53:29.930
feel free to insult me

765
53:30.640 --> 53:32.360
to make yourself feel better.

766
53:32.500 --> 53:33.560
So we can be even.

767
53:38.480 --> 53:39.320
Fine.

768
53:41.120 --> 53:42.550
You're crazy, heartless,

769
53:42.570 --> 53:44.760
cocky, pretentious, narcissistic, irritating!

770
53:45.010 --> 53:46.840
Your words are harsh as if you're angry all the time.

771
53:47.040 --> 53:49.540
Do you think the world revolves around you or something?

772
53:49.570 --> 53:51.920
You always keep a cold face,

773
53:51.950 --> 53:55.600
but actually, you're just a pretentious guy acting all tough.

774
53:56.180 --> 53:57.600
You're a broken microwave!

775
53:57.620 --> 53:58.900
You can't heat things up properly,

776
53:58.920 --> 54:00.200
and you even black out.

777
54:00.420 --> 54:02.700
Stop acting like you're the most handsome guy already.

778
54:02.720 --> 54:03.800
It's annoying!

779
54:08.420 --> 54:09.440
Why are you quiet?

780
54:10.060 --> 54:11.000
Go on.

781
54:13.730 --> 54:15.360
I'm not mad at you,

782
54:18.540 --> 54:19.810
because what you said

783
54:20.220 --> 54:21.320
was not wrong.

784
54:23.780 --> 54:25.200
I have to thank you

785
54:25.440 --> 54:26.720
for reminding me.

786
54:33.800 --> 54:35.320
Then tomorrow...

787
54:35.460 --> 54:37.200
I don't want to learn about sex from you anymore.

788
54:44.030 --> 54:44.840
Gear?

789
54:46.090 --> 54:48.360
I'm sorry for wasting your time.

790
54:49.110 --> 54:49.960
And...

791
54:50.560 --> 54:51.920
thank you for everything.

792
55:08.290 --> 55:16.200
♫That this love is meant for you and me♫

793
55:18.000 --> 55:19.480
Here, this is for you.

794
55:19.620 --> 55:20.800
Mr. Kanthi?

795
55:21.440 --> 55:22.040
What?

796
55:22.060 --> 55:23.760
You asked him to teach you about sex,

797
55:23.800 --> 55:25.740
but you don't want to learn that from him anymore.

798
55:25.760 --> 55:27.120
Is that why he's following you around?

799
55:27.400 --> 55:28.880
When will you stop running away?

800
55:28.900 --> 55:31.040
Why are you following me, then?

801
55:32.400 --> 55:33.600
Are you ready, my love?

802
55:33.760 --> 55:34.840
I've been ready since yesterday.

803
55:35.360 --> 55:36.920
Hold on tight, alright?

804
55:37.160 --> 55:38.280
I'm going to take you for a spin.

805
55:39.040 --> 55:40.200
Mr. Shin,

806
55:40.500 --> 55:42.680
where should we go after dinner?

807
55:42.920 --> 55:44.160
You can decide for us, Ms. Mei.

808
55:44.640 --> 55:46.320
Let's go see a movie, then.

809
56:02.380 --> 56:05.760
♫Thank you for teaching me♫

810
56:05.780 --> 56:09.860
♫What love can be♫

811
56:09.880 --> 56:12.120
♫"Love" used to mean nothing,♫

812
56:12.140 --> 56:17.460
♫But now it's starting to have a meaning♫

813
56:17.480 --> 56:20.980
♫The love you gave me♫

814
56:21.000 --> 56:25.380
♫Was very fulfilling, you helped me realize♫

815
56:25.400 --> 56:33.020
♫That this love is meant for you and me♫
